                  owl:deprecated "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
                  skos:definition "Symmetry equivalency assertion is an information content entity which is used to infer crystallographic equivalence between single crystallographic direction /plane and family of directions/planes if the equivalence applies for the given crystal symmetry."@en .


